title: "Cost-Effectiveness of Diagnostic and Treatment Strategies for Severe Angina: A Decision-Analytic Health Technology Assessment"
abstract: >-
  A decision-analytic Health Technology Assessment comparing no treatment,
  medical management, exercise stress testing, and direct coronary angiography
  for severe-angina referrals in a Sheffield cardiology department. Built to the
  NICE reference case using a decision tree, Bayesian probability revision, QALY
  estimation, net-monetary-benefit decision rules, and one-way, two-way, and
  value-of-improvement sensitivity analyses.
type: report
authors:
